[00:00.00] 作词 : 椎名林檎
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 椎名林檎
[00:14.34] now I'm seventeen (现在我十七岁了)
[00:17.11] my school is in the country (我的学校在乡下)
[00:20.89] students wear trainers (学生们脚踩运动鞋)
[00:23.77] read the same magazines (阅读那些同样的杂志)
[00:27.10] now I'm seventeen (现在我十七岁了)
[00:30.43] my school is getting tiresome (我的学校变得越来越烦人)
[00:34.06] teachers-they're so young (老师们太年轻了)
[00:36.68] singling me out (把我区别对待)
[00:40.47] only like philosophy & after school the time (只有像是哲学课和放学后的时光)
[00:45.40] that's what i call my own my own time (才是我所谓的个人时间)
[00:53.83] nice girls meet nice boys end of school day (俊男靓女们在放学后相会)
[00:58.92] while other girls go straight home (同时其他的女孩们直接回了家)
[01:06.23] talking 'bout soaps'n' that (聊着肥皂剧和琐事)
[01:10.37] I go home alone (我独自回家)
[01:13.40] like it watching the nameless people (钟爱观察身旁无名的人流)
[01:19.80] surfing subways,travelling somewhere (在地铁上冲浪，旅行到某个地方)
[01:21.62] "…nowhere…" (“……无处可去……”)
[01:37.25] now I'm seventeen i do not have a title (现在我十七岁了 我没有任何标签)
[01:44.17] depend on no one else busy being kind (别指望别人忙着做好事)
[01:51.54] only like philosophy and after school the time (只有像是哲学课和放学后的时光)
[01:57.26] that's what i call my own my own time (才是我所谓的个人时间)
[02:03.78] nice girls meet nice boys end of school day (俊男靓女们在放学后相会)
[02:08.82] while other girls go straight  home (同时其他的女孩们直接回了家)
[02:13.16] talking 'bout soaps'n' that (聊着肥皂剧和琐事)
[02:16.79] I go home alone and have dinner (我独自回家吃晚饭)
[02:26.43] in my sweet home praying again, (在我甜蜜的家中一遍遍地祈祷着)
[02:33.39] again and again （"…peace…"） (一遍又一遍（“……和平……”）)
[02:42.21] I see the same faces in school (我在学校里看见那些同样的面孔)
[02:50.17] and they say that I am different I think it's an honour (他们说我与众不同 我认为那是一项荣誉)
[02:59.91] I say it's an honour to be different (我说与众不同很光荣)
[03:06.95] I can't go their way (我不能和他们走同样的路)
[03:23.36] surfing subways,travelling somewhere (在地铁上冲浪，旅行到某个地方)
[03:30.12] "…nowhere…" (“……无处可去……”)
[03:36.88] I go home alone and have dinner (我独自回家吃晚饭)
[03:46.51] in my sweet sweet home praying again, (在我甜蜜的家中一遍遍地祈祷着)
[03:53.38] again and again （"…peace…"） (一遍又一遍（“……和平……”）)
[04:03.32] now I'm seventeen (现在我十七岁了)
[04:14.53] now I'm …seventeen… (现在我“……十七岁了……”)